          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Threading mark drawn live: brand threads under System, the theme's accent under a style. Rest, then Weave, Breathe and Orbit from left to right; Weave is held at one box-tumble pose, Preview plays the whole route, and Replay shows the launch stitch." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Threading-märket ritat live: varumärkets trådar under System, temats accent under en stil. Vila, sedan Väv, Andning och Omlopp från vänster till höger; Väv hålls i en pose från boxens tumling, Förhandsvisning spelar hela rutten och Repris visar startsömmen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Threading mark drawn live: brand threads under System, the theme's accent under a style. Rest, then Weave, Breathe and Orbit from left to right; preview the hover motion or replay the launch stitch." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Threading-märket ritat live: varumärkets trådar under System, temats accent under en stil. Vila, sedan Väv, Andas och Omlopp från vänster till höger; förhandsvisa hovringsrörelsen eller spela upp startsömmen igen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Threading that owns the session state has not answered for %lld seconds. You can end it and start this one instead. Anything it was in the middle of is lost." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
