    },
    "The border drawn around a takeover window's edges, seated by the theme's border role." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The border drawn around a takeover window's edges, seated by the theme's border role."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bottom band of a pane: hairline, band height, and controls whose ink sits on the stated margin — corner-adapted when the band meets a rounded window corner." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Det nedre bandet i en panel: hårfin linje, bandhöjd och kontroller vars innehåll ligger på den angivna marginalen. Hörnet anpassas när bandet möter ett rundat fönsterhörn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bounded Activity overview above the filesystem tree: the repository atlas, action ribbon, counts, and recent agents share one stable file axis even when the checkout has thousands of files." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den begränsade aktivitetsöversikten ovanför filsystemsträdet: kodförrådets atlas, åtgärdsband, antal och senaste agenter delar en stabil filaxel även när arbetskopian har tusentals filer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bounded surface a document is drawn on. Its three grounds: the pane’s own surface, the checkerboard that says the document has transparency, and nothing at all." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den begränsade ytan ett dokument ritas på. Dess tre bakgrunder: rutans egen yta, schackrutmönstret som säger att dokumentet har genomskinlighet, och ingenting alls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brokered URL could not be parsed." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den förmedlade URL:en kunde inte tolkas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The browser sign-in timed out. Nothing was registered." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Webbläsarinloggningen tog för lång tid. Ingenting registrerades."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The capture is %lld bytes, over the %lld byte limit for one baseline." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bilden är %lld byte, över gränsen på %lld byte för en baslinje."
          }
