          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The spectrum material's workload reading in place of the brand: seven fixed bands off the shared AgentIntensity envelope, the working count in one-bit figures, and MAX at provider-relative top effort. Decorative, and it drives no timer while hidden, idle, or under Reduce Motion." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spektrummaterialets avläsning av arbetsbelastning i stället för varumärket: sju fasta band från den delade AgentIntensity-kurvan, antalet arbetande sessioner i enbitssiffror och MAX vid leverantörsrelativ toppinsats. Dekorativ, och den driver ingen timer medan den är dold, overksam eller under Reducera rörelse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stored baseline image no longer matches its approved revision." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den sparade baslinjebilden stämmer inte längre med den godkända revisionen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stored review no longer matches Threading’s generated branch, so the remote branch was left in place." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den lagrade granskningen matchar inte längre Threadings genererade gren, så fjärrgrenen lämnades kvar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stored test credential could not be read." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den sparade testinloggningen kunde inte läsas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The strip those tabs live in: select, close, drag a chip along it, or reorder from its secondary-click menu." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den strim som de flikar lever i: välj, stäng, dra en chip längs den eller ordna om från dess sekundära klickmeny."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The structured child transcript has not arrived yet." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den strukturerade barntranskriptionen har inte kommit än."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The supervision record could not be saved." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Övervakningsposten kunde inte sparas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The table, outline, header, scroll, and clip boundaries are real AppKit views." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tabellen, utkastet, rubriken, scrollen och klippgränserna är verkliga AppKit-vyer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The target branch moved while the session was working. The workspace was kept for review." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Målgrenen flyttades medan sessionen arbetade. Arbetsytan behölls för granskning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terminal theme could not be saved." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terminaltemat kunde inte sparas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The test credential was not added" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Testinloggningen lades inte till"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text “%@” is %@ (%@) on %@ (%@): %@. Threading shows it as sent. Use default foreground (ANSI 39), or change themes." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Texten ”%@” är %@ (%@) på %@ (%@): %@. Threading visar färgen som den skickades. Använd standardförgrund (ANSI 39) eller byt tema."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The theme file could not be found." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Temafil hittades inte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The theme file is missing required color definitions." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Temafil saknar obligatoriska färgdefinitioner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The thread only. The terminal keeps its own font in Profile." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Endast tråden. Terminalen behåller sin egen typsnitt i Profil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The three bounded search landings. Switch destinations, type or change scope, scroll the virtualized results, and use their close controls." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De tre avgränsade sökdestinationerna. Byt destination, skriv eller ändra omfattning, rulla de virtualiserade resultaten och använd deras stängningskontroller."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The title band with square-plate buttons, and the bare-glyph style on its own ground." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The title band with square-plate buttons, and the bare-glyph style on its own ground."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transport a host-owned media player wears: play/pause, the scrubber and a monospaced-digit reading. It owns no clock — it states what it was told and raises what the user did." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kontrollerna som en värdägd mediaspelare bär: spela/pausa, reglaget och en avläsning med fasta siffror. Den äger ingen klocka — den visar det den fått veta och rapporterar det användaren gjorde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trigger run needs review." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utlösarkörningen behöver granskas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The turn baseline has expired." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baslinjen för turen har upphört att gälla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The turn end was captured, but its metadata could not be persisted." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turens sluttillstånd sparades, men dess metadata kunde inte beständiggöras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The turn in flight is lost." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Det pågående svaret går förlorat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The turn start was captured, but its metadata could not be persisted." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turens starttillstånd sparades, men dess metadata kunde inte beständiggöras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update for %@ changed after it was reviewed. Check what it now asks for and try again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uppdateringen för %@ har ändrats efter att den granskats. Kontrollera vad den nu efterfrågar och försök igen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The update for %@ declares data version %lld, but the installed package already uses %lld. Data versions cannot decrease." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uppdateringen för %@ deklarerar dataversion %lld, men det installerade paketet använder redan %lld. Dataversionen får inte sänkas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The value does not match extension setting “%@”." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Värdet stämmer inte med tilläggsinställningen ”%@”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The visual subtree is replaced; the surrounding host shell remains native." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Det visuella underträdet ersätts; den omgivande värdskalen förblir egen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wash a search leaves on the row it scrolled to — the search-match ground fading in, standing a beat, and leaving. Flash replays it; the hold survives Reduce Motion because a hold is not movement." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Svepet en sökning lämnar på raden den rullade till — sökträffens ton som tonar in, står ett slag och lämnar. Blinka spelar upp det igen; pausen överlever Minskad rörelse eftersom en paus inte är rörelse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The way past a spent usage limit. Three states: the offer, the same offer being carried out, and one that could not be taken. The button names the whole action, which is why pressing it asks nothing further." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vägen förbi en förbrukad användningsgräns. Tre lägen: erbjudandet, samma erbjudande medan det utförs, och ett som inte gick att ta. Knappen namnger hela sin åtgärd, vilket är varför ett tryck inte frågar något mer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The whole sidecar the inspector hangs beside a picture: the list, how many of the twenty are used, what the chat has already been given, and the one press that gives it the rest. The inspector supplies the pixels and the mutations; the pane owns the layout." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hela sidopanelen som inspektören hänger bredvid en bild: listan, hur många av de tjugo som används, vad chatten redan har fått, och det enda tryck som ger den resten. Inspektören levererar pixlarna och ändringarna; panelen äger layouten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The workspace file “%@” was moved, deleted, or is outside this checkout. Remove it and add the current file before sending." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Arbetsytefilen ”%@” har flyttats, raderats eller ligger utanför utcheckningen. Ta bort den och lägg till den aktuella filen innan du skickar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The workspace window is no longer available." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Arbetsytefönstret är inte längre tillgängligt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their own workspace, kept for review" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En egen arbetsyta, sparad för granskning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their own workspace, merged when finished" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En egen arbetsyta, sammanfogad när den är klar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
