      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tidszon: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tinted template glyphs drawn on the device pixel grid; a slot caps foreign artwork." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tonade mallglyfer ritade på enhetens pixelrutnät; en lucka begränsar främmande bildmaterial."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rubrik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Till"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To arrive on your iPhone, a notification travels through Apple's push service, and its title is the chat's name — usually the one the agent chose. Tool arguments, paths and diffs are deliberately left out. This happens only while Remote Access is on." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "För att nå din iPhone färdas en avisering via Apples pushtjänst, och rubriken är chattens namn – oftast det agenten valde. Verktygsargument, sökvägar och diffar utelämnas medvetet. Det här sker bara när Fjärråtkomst är på."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ToastView" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ToastView"
